    "full_description": "### Product Overview & Technical Specifications\nThe official **Cloudray** component is engineered for professional laser workshops and high-precision CNC laser applications. Manufactured under strict quality control standards, it ensures maximum durability, thermal stability, and exact tolerances.\n\n#### Key Features:\n- **Authentic Brand Engineering:** 100% genuine Cloudray factory equipment ensuring true-to-spec performance and longevity.\n- **Universal Compatibility:** Fully supported across leading laser control software (LightBurn, LaserGRBL) and mainstream desktop/industrial frames (xTool, Creality, Ortur, Atomstack, Sculpfun, CO2 systems).\n- **Workshop Reliability:** Reduces operational wear, protects sensitive focal optics from soot buildup, and delivers clean, repeatable processing passes.\n\n#### Manufacturer Details:\nAuthentic T5 1064nm Fiber Laser Safety Goggles assembly, pre-calibrated and ready for plug-and-play installation.\n\n#### Maintenance & Usage Guidelines:\nKeep optical and moving contact surfaces free of debris using lint-free optical wipes. Adhere to specified voltage and duty cycles for maximum lifespan.",
