    "full_description": "### Product Overview & Technical Specifications\nThe official **Sculpfun** component is engineered for professional laser workshops and high-precision CNC laser applications. Manufactured under strict quality control standards, it ensures maximum durability, thermal stability, and exact tolerances.\n\n#### Key Features:\n- **Authentic Brand Engineering:** 100% genuine Sculpfun factory equipment ensuring true-to-spec performance and longevity.\n- **Universal Compatibility:** Fully supported across leading laser control software (LightBurn, LaserGRBL) and mainstream desktop/industrial frames (xTool, Creality, Ortur, Atomstack, Sculpfun, CO2 systems).\n- **Workshop Reliability:** Reduces operational wear, protects sensitive focal optics from soot buildup, and delivers clean, repeatable processing passes.\n\n#### Manufacturer Details:\nNote : TS1 is not compatible with C1 mini laser. Main Features: 1. Offline Engraving : Simply copy the engraving or cutting files to the touch screen SD card, and then finish the engraving or cutting work offline through the 3.5-inch touch screen for convenience and practicality. 2. WiFi Connection : SCULPFUN TS1 touch screen can empower the different brands of laser engravers to get WiFi function, which can realize the functionality of real-time slicing without the need of computers when used with SCULPFUN mobile APP, making it easy and quick. 3. 3.5-inch Capacitive Touch Screen : The TS1 laser engraver touch screen features with a 3.5-inch capacitive touch screen design, bringing clear rea...\n\n#### Maintenance & Usage Guidelines:\nKeep optical and moving contact surfaces free of debris using lint-free optical wipes. Adhere to specified voltage and duty cycles for maximum lifespan.",
