    "full_description": "### Technical Specifications & Printing Guidelines\nThe official **Elegoo Silk Shiny PLA** 1.75mm filament is engineered for high-performance 3D printing across FDM/FFF machines. Manufactured with strict laser-guided diameter control (±0.02mm), it delivers buttery-smooth extrusion without clogs or tangling.\n\n#### Key Features & Advantages:\n- **High-luster**: High-luster metallic reflection mimics precious metals and lustrous silks\n- **Produces**: Produces breathtaking decorative art, jewelry holders, and custom gifts\n- **Consistent**: Consistent flow without foaming or clogging\n- **Spool & Packaging:** Vacuum-sealed with industrial desiccant in heavy-duty moisture-barrier aluminum/poly bag.\n- **Universal Printer Compatibility:** 100% compatible with Bambu Lab (X1/P1P/P1S/A1), Creality (Ender, K1/K1C), Elegoo (Neptune 3/4), Prusa (MK3/MK4/XL), Anycubic, and Voron.\n\n#### Recommended Print Parameters:\n- **Nozzle Temperature:** 200 - 230 °C\n- **Heated Bed Temperature:** 45 - 60 °C\n- **Printing Speed:** 30 - 200 mm/s\n- **Cooling Fan:** 100%\n- **Build Surface:** Textured PEI, Smooth PEI, Glass, or Engineering Plate\n\n#### Available Color Options:\nSilk Gold, Silk Silver, Silk Copper, Silk Cyan, Silk Rose Gold, Silk Violet",
